/ Nonnegative signed-16-bit inputs only.
/ Result is Z + max(X,Y), or -1 on a negative input or overflow.
ORG 100
Input
Store X
Skipcond 000
Jump ReadY
Jump Error
ReadY, Input
Store Y
Skipcond 000
Jump ReadZ
Jump Error
ReadZ, Input
Store Z
Skipcond 000
Jump Choose
Jump Error
Choose, Load X
Subt Y
Skipcond 000
Jump UseX
Jump UseY
UseX, Load X
Store Addend
Jump CheckSum
UseY, Load Y
Store Addend
CheckSum, Load MaxValue
Subt Addend
Subt Z
Skipcond 000
Jump AddSafe
Jump Error
AddSafe, Load Z
Add Addend
Output
Halt
Error, Load NegOne
Output
Halt
X, DEC 0
Y, DEC 0
Z, DEC 0
Addend, DEC 0
MaxValue, DEC 32767
NegOne, DEC -1
END
